  "supersedes": "a hand-assembled summary that @Reviewer requested changes on. Every structural objection was correct: no assembler, no hashes, no raw inputs, mixed generator provenance (device 5 run 0 came from generator 3fcf0041, a revision never committed to this repository), a reducer chosen after seeing the data, and ratios that silently selected run 0. See the module docstring.",
